        "content": "<p>I want to rewrite <a href=\"https://github.com/natefaubion/purescript-language-cst-parser\">https://github.com/natefaubion/purescript-language-cst-parser</a> in lean</p>\n<p>here is repo <a href=\"https://github.com/srghma/purescript-language-cst-parser/tree/lean\">https://github.com/srghma/purescript-language-cst-parser/tree/lean</a></p>\n<p>I want to try to use fixpioints and catamorphisms, etc. E.g. like</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TypeF</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type_e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- ...</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Constrained</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">type_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type_e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">token</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SourceToken</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type_e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parens</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wrapped</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Wrapped</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type_e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Repr</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BEq</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Type_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TypeF</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Type_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Repr</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BEq</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>but code is very slow </p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/srghma/purescript-language-cst-parser/commit/c8c7cad2be058fb6817d986d7909b8210e382097\">https://github.com/srghma/purescript-language-cst-parser/commit/c8c7cad2be058fb6817d986d7909b8210e382097</a> - <code>~19 minutes</code> <a href=\"https://pastebin.com/fPQBcnjz\">https://pastebin.com/fPQBcnjz</a></li>\n<li>and if I return mututal <a href=\"https://github.com/srghma/purescript-language-cst-parser/commit/6b8b64cf76133b378fc1fee93a5a8e75dada1aa2\">https://github.com/srghma/purescript-language-cst-parser/commit/6b8b64cf76133b378fc1fee93a5a8e75dada1aa2</a> - <code>1 minute 50 seconds</code>  - <a href=\"https://pastebin.com/gcBqBzYM\">https://pastebin.com/gcBqBzYM</a> and most of time (46.3s) it spends on <code>inductive InstanceBinding</code> (which is right after <code>mutual</code> and is using one of <code>mutual</code>s)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>is there some technique to preserve functors and make compilation faster?</p>",
